<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαψῳδ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recitation of Epic poetry</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				533b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆθλα . . οἱ πατέρες ἔθεσαν
			ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				21b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Epic composition</i>, opp. lyric (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιθαρῳδία</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἐπιδεικνύναι
			ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				658b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι</span>(
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					62
				</span></i>
			: generally, of all kinds of poetry, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν μικτὴν ῥ. ἐξ ἁπάντων μέτρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1447b22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>portion of an Epic poem fit for recitation at one time</i>,
			e.g. a <i>book</i> of the Iliad or Odyssey, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.186e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				20.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cont.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			contemptuously, <i>rigmarole</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.514c
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
